    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "New Penthouse Show Apartment Now On View.\r\n\r\n143 Merrion Road by Lioncor will blend chic, contemporary design with timeless finishes and will be a landmark development for Dublin 4.\r\n \r\nWhether you’re looking for a bright and spacious apartment with breath-taking sea views, a one of a kind penthouse or a one bedroom apartment in the heart of Dublin’s most sought after location, 143 Merrion Road will offer all of this and more with 63 one, two and three bedroom apartments and penthouses on offer.\r\n \r\n143 is a bespoke development of just 63 apartments in total built over five floors and includes a stunning roof design that will make the apartment block a stand out in the Dublin skyline.  With much of the building overlooking Dublin Bay, 143 Merrion Road is located just a short walk from Sandymount Strand with miles of spectacular beach. \r\n \r\nIn addition, there are a vast array of boutique stores, food retailers and eateries all within walking distance in nearby Sandymount, Ballsbridge and Donnybrook with Sydney Parade Dart Station providing access to Dublin’s major business districts in under 10 minutes.\r\n \r\nFurther details at www.143merrion.ie\r\n\r\nLioncor is an Irish residential property development company delivering new homes nationwide. They have built a number of new homes developments in Dublin, Wicklow, Limerick and Galway and are currently active on sites in Blackrock, Sandymount Strand and Cork. For further information about Lioncor see www.lioncor.ie"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "A bespoke development, incorporating just 63, one, two and three bedroom apartments on Merrion Road\r\n•\tLocated in Ballsbridge, one of the capital’s most coveted neighbourhoods. \r\n•\tSea views from top floors to Sandymount Strand and east towards Dun Laoghaire Harbour\r\n•\tModern, contemporary A2/A3 rated homes. \r\n•\tSuperior quality finishes built by Lioncor construction.\r\n•\tWalking distance to Ballsbridge village and Sandymount strand. \r\n•\tSecured internal landscaped courtyard, designed by MMP landscape architects\r\n•\tA short stroll from Sydney Parade train station\r\n•\tNear south Dublin’s top academic institutions such as trinity college, UCD, Blackrock college St. Michael's\r\n•\tSecure underground parking with most apartments"
      },
